<section id="bbs004" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Numbered agenda as one divided vertical grid; each row is a short title and one line of scope, numbered by the grid's own markers.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="N5qlmI2Ctr"><h2>Agenda</h2><grid style="--marker-inline-size: 32pt; --marker-gap: 14pt" vertical-sizing="hug" direction="vertical" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" marker-position="inline" marker="number" divider="sm neutral-border"><grid-item padding="12pt 0" id="BOO-SvctMF"><h4>Where we are</h4><p>Results against the plan and what changed since the last review.</p></grid-item><grid-item padding="12pt 0" id="0OEOU2P6jX"><h4>What we learned</h4><p>Three findings from customers, operations, and the finance close.</p></grid-item><grid-item padding="12pt 0" id="qBKV-yibO6"><h4>The plan</h4><p>Priorities for the next two quarters and how they fit together.</p></grid-item><grid-item padding="12pt 0" id="dA4JOoRTlY"><h4>Resources</h4><p>Budget, hiring, and the tools each team needs to deliver.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>